# Local "source of truth" for the Gemini API key — never committed (.env is gitignored).
# This file is committed; it documents which variable lives here so a fresh checkout
# knows what to fill in.
#
# Where to get a key:    https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Lock it down:          API restrictions → Restrict key → "Generative Language API"
#
# Where the value goes next (copy the same key into both):
#   1. worker/.dev.vars  →  GEMINI_API_KEY="<paste>"   (local `npm run dev`)
#   2. CF prod secret    →  cd worker && npx wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY
#                           (paste when prompted; never commit the prod value)
#
# Naming note: this file uses GEMINI_KEY while the worker reads env.GEMINI_API_KEY —
# the .env at root is a manual notes file, not auto-loaded by Workers/Vite. Worth
# normalising at some point; not a runtime issue today.

GEMINI_KEY=paste-your-google-ai-studio-key-here
